# Files in the shared Wine tree that THIS project owns, vendored into wine/ as real source.
#
# EXPLICIT LIST, NEVER A GLOB. A glob would start sweeping the other session's work into our
# history the first time they touched a neighbouring file.
#
# Ownership follows AGENTS.md's "files that are not yours": dlls/kernelbase, dlls/ntdll,
# dlls/win32u, dlls/user32, dlls/combase, dlls/d3d11, dlls/windows.graphics, dlls/wintypes,
# server/ and include/ are theirs and are deliberately absent (~5,000 lines of changes).
#
# Derived once from committed changes since upstream, working-tree changes, AND untracked files -
# all three are needed. Deriving it from `git diff UP..HEAD` alone silently drops every file we
# only ever edited in the working tree, which is most of the Media Player work.
